#, kde-format
msgid "Context Menu"
msgstr "Kontekstni meni"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QTreeWidget, listViewCommands)
#: configdlg.ui:559
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In this area you can add the custom entries for your context menu: "
"<ol><li>push the <b>Add</b> button to add a new entry in the list;</"
"li><li>edit the entry by double clicking in the <b>Menu text</b> and "
"<b>Command</b> columns.</li></ol>If you need to execute the command as root "
"user check the corresponding <b>Root</b> check box."
msgstr ""
"<html><p>Ovde možete dodati posebne unose u kontekstni meni:</"
"p><ol><li>dugmetom <interface>Dodaj novi unos</interface> dodajete unos na "
"spisak;</li><li>postojeći unos uređujete dvoklikom na kolone "
"<interface>tekst menija</interface> i <interface>naredba</interface>.</li></"
"ol><p>Ako je naredbu potrebno pokrenuti pod korijenim korisnikom popunite "
"pridruženu kućicu <interface>koren</interface></p>.</html>."

